msgstr "- Corrections de la connexion rapide"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:455
msgid "- Add option to save Quick Connect host"
msgstr "- Ajout d’une option permettant d’enregistrer l’hôte d’une connexion rapide"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:456
msgid ""
"- Added option to rename a tab - Double-click any terminal tab to rename"
msgstr "- Ajout d’une option permettant de renommer un onglet — double-cliquez sur un onglet de terminal pour le renommer"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:457
msgid "- Added support for Wake on Lan"
msgstr "- Ajout de la prise en charge de Wake-on-LAN"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:458
msgid "- Added pre-connection command support"
msgstr "- Ajout de la prise en charge des commandes de préconnexion"

